# ---- Secrets, Credentials & Project Theft Prevention ----
# Ignore rules do not protect secrets pasted into tracked source or remove Git history.
# Keep real credentials in ignored local files or the deployment secret store.
# Environment variables (API keys, Supabase service role, Google Drive secrets)
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.env.*
# Only sanitized examples belong in source control.
!.env.example
.envrc
.direnv/
env.json
secrets.json
secret.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
secrets.toml
.secrets/
secrets/
.credentials/
credentials/
local.settings.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json

